<main class="Layout-module__content___wEYFD" id="content"><header class="HeroWithProducts-module__root___k9HYV" data-custom-color="false"><div class="HeroWithProducts-module__content___P5K3n"><h1 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo HeroWithProducts-module__title___LsNhb" data-font-size="md">A committed sun care range</h1><div class="ProductStripCarousel-module__root___-WOjq HeroWithProducts-module__carousel___EjHw3" data-total="5"><button class="ProductStripCarousel-module__button___Q1t0M swiper-button-prev" type="button"></button><button class="ProductStripCarousel-module__button___Q1t0M swiper-button-next" type="button"></button><div class="ProductStripCarousel-module__pagination___U376y swiper-pagination"></div><div class="swiper ProductStripCarousel-module__carousel___BWVur"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide ProductStripCarousel-module__slide___IoQfc"><div class="ProductStripLoader-module__root___uqMHI"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide ProductStripCarousel-module__slide___IoQfc"><div class="ProductStripLoader-module__root___uqMHI"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide ProductStripCarousel-module__slide___IoQfc"><div class="ProductStripLoader-module__root___uqMHI"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide ProductStripCarousel-module__slide___IoQfc"><div class="ProductStripLoader-module__root___uqMHI"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide ProductStripCarousel-module__slide___IoQfc"><div class="ProductStripLoader-module__root___uqMHI"></div></div></div><div class="swiper-scrollbar"></div></div></div></div><div class="HeroWithProducts-module__media___4d-v4"><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=100/resize=200 200w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=95/resize=400 400w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=90/resize=600 600w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=86/resize=800 800w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=83/resize=1000 1000w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070?twic=v1/quality=80/resize=1200 1200w" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/1371x1070/60f75a878b/la-protection-solaire-efficace-et-respectueuse-de-la-peau-des-oceans.jpg/m/1371x1070" width="1371" height="1070" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 58.3333vw, 100vw" alt="" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async"/></div></header><section id="section-71d0cce2-c2db-4d47-a1a9-7911ecb596d0" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y SingleColumnTextWithAccordion-module__root___UhaTt" data-background="white" data-custom-color="false"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="md" id="the-formulation-of-sun-care-products-a-real-challenge-for-the-oceans">The formulation of sun care products: a real challenge for the oceans</h2><p>Things weren’t easy; for a long time, we almost gave up on creating a sun care range because, despite our research, we couldn’t find the ideal formula that didn’t compromise either skin protection or ocean preservation.</p><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/1072x746/ce9b740cec/aux-cotes-de-the-coral-planters-la-rosee-participe-a-la-sauvegarde-et-a-la-plantation-de-coraux-aux-maldives.jpeg/m/1072x746?twic=v1/resize=1072 1x, https://larosee.twic.pics/1072x746/ce9b740cec/aux-cotes-de-the-coral-planters-la-rosee-participe-a-la-sauvegarde-et-a-la-plantation-de-coraux-aux-maldives.jpeg/m/1072x746?twic=v1/resize=2144 2x, https://larosee.twic.pics/1072x746/ce9b740cec/aux-cotes-de-the-coral-planters-la-rosee-participe-a-la-sauvegarde-et-a-la-plantation-de-coraux-aux-maldives.jpeg/m/1072x746?twic=v1/resize=3216 3x" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/1072x746/ce9b740cec/aux-cotes-de-the-coral-planters-la-rosee-participe-a-la-sauvegarde-et-a-la-plantation-de-coraux-aux-maldives.jpeg/m/1072x746" width="1072" height="746" alt="Aux côtés de The Coral Planters, La Rosée participe à la sauvegarde et à la plantation de coraux aux Maldives" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionItem-module__root___5x7iI" data-rounded="false"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2q6ll4l_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_q6ll4l_" class="AccordionTrigger-module__root___IRk5g" data-size="lg" data-bold="false" data-radix-collection-item="">Coral reefs are the temple of marine life.</button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2q6ll4l_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_q6ll4l_" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionContent-module__root___EyqbN" data-size="md" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionItem-module__root___5x7iI" data-rounded="false"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_3a6ll4l_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1a6ll4l_" class="AccordionTrigger-module__root___IRk5g" data-size="lg" data-bold="false" data-radix-collection-item="">Alarming figures</button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_3a6ll4l_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1a6ll4l_" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionContent-module__root___EyqbN" data-size="md" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionItem-module__root___5x7iI" data-rounded="false"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_3q6ll4l_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1q6ll4l_" class="AccordionTrigger-module__root___IRk5g" data-size="lg" data-bold="false" data-radix-collection-item="">Coral bleaching</button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_3q6ll4l_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1q6ll4l_" data-orientation="vertical" class="AccordionContent-module__root___EyqbN" data-size="md" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div></div></section><div id="section-d42de449-46df-4325-9c07-281eef53cb3d" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y RichText-module__root___KPAL-" data-background="white" data-text-alignment="left"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v RichText-module__content___xefl8"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="md" id="a-solution-that-effectively-protects-skin-while-being-more-respectful-of-the-marine-ecosystem">A solution that effectively protects skin while being more respectful of the marine ecosystem</h2><p>Based on this observation, it was simply unthinkable to create sun protection products that could have a harmful effect on our marine environment.</p><p>We were determined to create sun care that protects the skin effectively—while limiting its impact on the oceans. After new research, multiple trials, and some setbacks, we finally found the solution!</p></div></div><div id="section-fcaea5f1-0203-4ed7-9b56-3caf6c0d5ce1" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y MediaWithText-module__root___6cuDw" data-background="white" data-media-position="left" data-custom-color="false"><div class="MediaWithText-module__content___zf3At"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v MediaWithText-module__text___1zGUb"><h3 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="sm" id="a-base-formula-with-organic-apricot-oil">A base formula with organic apricot oil...</h3><h4 id="the-ingredients-were-carefully-selected-for-their-effectiveness">The ingredients were carefully selected for their effectiveness</h4><ul><li>No controversial ingredients and a 100% natural-origin scent.</li><li>We have chosen organic apricot oil as the main active ingredient for our range. It nourishes the skin and leaves a radiant tan.</li></ul></div></div><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=100/resize=200 200w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=95/resize=400 400w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=90/resize=600 600w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=86/resize=800 800w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=83/resize=1000 1000w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=80/resize=1200 1200w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=76/resize=1400 1400w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=74/resize=1600 1600w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280?twic=v1/quality=71/resize=1800 1800w" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1280/872b6599bd/nos-solaires-se-composent-d-une-base-de-formule-naturelle-a-l-huile-d-abricot-bio.jpg/m/1920x1280" width="1920" height="1280" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 50vw, 100vw" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="MediaWithText-module__media___IYVJj"/></div><div id="section-adf2066d-2204-4f6b-b400-c178359c6d7a" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y MediaWithText-module__root___6cuDw" data-background="white" data-media-position="right" data-custom-color="false"><div class="MediaWithText-module__content___zf3At"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v MediaWithText-module__text___1zGUb"><h3 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="sm" id="-and-new-generation-organic-uv-filters">... and new generation organic UV filters</h3><h4 id="our-uv-filters-represent-a-strong-choice-for-us">Our UV filters represent a strong choice for us.</h4><p>Until now, there were two different types of filters available. We ruled them out because neither satisfied our standards—and for good reason:</p><ul><li>Mineral Filters: Zinc oxide and titanium dioxide reflect UV rays at the skin&#x27;s surface. In their nanoparticle form, these substances are suspected of being toxic to the body because they are impossible to eliminate. In the ocean, they may contribute to coral bleaching and be toxic to phytoplankton, which is at the base of the marine food chain.</li><li>Organic filters, (or &#x27;old-generation&#x27; chemical filters): These work by absorbing UV rays. Some of these filters are suspected of being endocrine disruptors, while others, may negatively affect the marine environment, notably contributing to coral bleaching.</li></ul><h4 id="we-focus-our-research-around-3-important-factors"><strong>We focus our research around 3 important factors:</strong></h4><ul><li>Broad-spectrum UVB/UVA protection to ensure maximum skin protection.</li><li>Water resistance to best protect and limit product dispersion as much as possible in the ocean. A film-forming agent has been added to improve water resistance during swimming.</li><li>Biodegradability: we have tested the biodegradability of all our formulas (according to OECD 301F standard).</li></ul><p>Subsequently, we conducted rigorous tests to verify the non-toxicity of our sun protection products on representative species of marine biodiversity.</p><p>Our sun care products have been proven to be more respectful, with minimal impact on coral viability and the growth of marine algae</p></div><a class="Button-module__root___Djkf0 MediaWithText-module__button___mWT0y" data-variant="flat" data-size="sm" type="button" href="/en-ww/pages/tests-solaires" data-discover="true">Learn more about our tests</a></div><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=100/resize=200 200w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=95/resize=400 400w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=90/resize=600 600w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=86/resize=800 800w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=83/resize=1000 1000w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=80/resize=1200 1200w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=76/resize=1400 1400w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=74/resize=1600 1600w, https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477?twic=v1/quality=71/resize=1800 1800w" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/1920x1477/230c09f703/nos-solaires-sont-composes-de-filtres-organiques-clean-nouvelle-generation.jpg/m/1920x1477" width="1920" height="1477" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 50vw, 100vw" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="MediaWithText-module__media___IYVJj"/></div><section id="section-b689fe8b-7918-4c81-bd47-9c66af8b49d9" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y TextWithProductCarousel-module__root___3KZuE" data-background="blue" data-custom-color="false"><div class="TextWithProductCarousel-module__content___ZcCtr"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo TextWithProductCarousel-module__title___wQLaT" data-font-size="md">A committed sun protection</h2><p class="TextWithProductCarousel-module__text___8ryWR">La Rosée sun care products feature a formula base with organic apricot oil + new generation UV filters.</p></div><div class="swiper TextWithProductCarousel-module__carousel___HgLRJ"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide TextWithProductCarousel-module__slide___bFm-k"><div class="ProductCardLoader-module__root___w7ZgD"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide TextWithProductCarousel-module__slide___bFm-k"><div class="ProductCardLoader-module__root___w7ZgD"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide TextWithProductCarousel-module__slide___bFm-k"><div class="ProductCardLoader-module__root___w7ZgD"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide TextWithProductCarousel-module__slide___bFm-k"><div class="ProductCardLoader-module__root___w7ZgD"></div></div><div class="swiper-slide TextWithProductCarousel-module__slide___bFm-k"><div class="ProductCardLoader-module__root___w7ZgD"></div></div></div><div class="swiper-button-prev"></div><div class="swiper-button-next"></div><div class="swiper-scrollbar"></div></div></section><div id="section-f2ce4a3b-e8b3-4c6a-95c7-0d58fa0df68b" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y RichText-module__root___KPAL-" data-background="white" data-text-alignment="left"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v RichText-module__content___xefl8"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="md" id="la-rosee-is-committed-alongside-the-coral-planters">La Rosée is committed alongside The Coral Planters!</h2><p>To combat the disappearance of coral reefs, we joined forces with The Coral Planters.</p><p>In 2022, we helped plant more than 12,000 coral fragments.</p><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/3000x2250/7753b11ad2/eng-tcp.jpg/m/3000x2250?twic=v1/resize=3000 1x, https://larosee.twic.pics/3000x2250/7753b11ad2/eng-tcp.jpg/m/3000x2250?twic=v1/resize=6000 2x, https://larosee.twic.pics/3000x2250/7753b11ad2/eng-tcp.jpg/m/3000x2250?twic=v1/resize=9000 3x" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/3000x2250/7753b11ad2/eng-tcp.jpg/m/3000x2250" width="3000" height="2250" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div><section id="section-693ffd8a-d682-4b2c-8761-2e3c2ccaba64" class="Section-module__root___58S5Y TextWithNotes-module__root___NiggV" data-background="white"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v TextWithNotes-module__text___Cm1U5"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="md" id="la-rosee-sun-care-products-protect-you-effectively">La Rosée sun care products protect you effectively.</h2><p><a class="Link-module__root___YqUoP" data-variant="underline" href="/en-ww/en/pages/les-solaires-humain" data-discover="true">Click here</a> to learn more!</p></div></section><aside class="NewsletterSection-module__root___j9mxB"><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/687x625/7de8cb25a6/pictogrammes_enveloppe-bleu.png/m/687x625?twic=v1/resize=687 1x, https://larosee.twic.pics/687x625/7de8cb25a6/pictogrammes_enveloppe-bleu.png/m/687x625?twic=v1/resize=1374 2x, https://larosee.twic.pics/687x625/7de8cb25a6/pictogrammes_enveloppe-bleu.png/m/687x625?twic=v1/resize=2061 3x" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/687x625/7de8cb25a6/pictogrammes_enveloppe-bleu.png/m/687x625" width="687" height="625" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="NewsletterSection-module__icon___O--LE"/><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo NewsletterSection-module__heading___PQV1f" data-font-size="md">Sign up for our newsletter!</h2><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v NewsletterSection-module__text___au1e0"><p>Receive a 10% discount when you sign up. Stay on top of exclusive previews, our best tips, and special offers just for you!</p></div><form class="NewsletterSection-module__form___gaiv9" data-discover="true" action="/contact?newsletter=true" method="post"><div><div class="Input-module__root___xpABX"><input title="" class="Input-module__control___V7V8B" placeholder="Email" required="" type="email" autoComplete="email" id="radix-_R_1ipl4l_" name="email"/><label class="Input-module__label___Uin1P" for="radix-_R_1ipl4l_">Email</label></div></div><div hidden=""><fieldset class="NewsletterSection-module__fieldset___pSWVk"><legend class="NewsletterSection-module__legend___a448c">What topics interest you? </legend><div class="Checkbox-module__root___BuAB8 NewsletterSection-module__checkbox___0-UPm"><input title="" class="Checkbox-module__control___UoIEa" type="checkbox" id="radix-_R_2aipl4l_" name="tags" value="La Rosée"/><label class="Checkbox-module__label___LJPVK" data-variant="